#. Translators: one of the accent color dropdown options in inspector
#: src/adw-inspector-page.c:181
msgid "Slate"
msgstr "Color pizarra"

#. Translators: the name of the library, not the stylesheet
#: src/adw-inspector-page.c:320
msgid "Adwaita"
